original_description_sprint:
Objective of this test is to verify that all SCM storage available on the nodes is accurately discovered using the dmg tool as follows:
{code:java}
$doas_shell -l host:1001 storage scan {code}
The functionality should be tested by invoking the dmg(daos_shell) tool.

*Expected results:* dmg tool should be able to scan and report information for all scm storage devices in a node.

