description:
Because GO binaries don't include usable build-ids we need to disable strict build-id enforcement in the DAOS build with:
{noformat}
%undefine _missing_build_ids_terminate_build {noformat}
For reference:

[https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/PackagingDrafts/Go#Build_ID]

[https://github.com/rpm-software-management/rpm/issues/367]

