description:
Objective of this test is to verify that all network interfaces being used by storage devices in the daos application are reported and discovered accurately.
{code:java}
$dmg network scan{code}
The functionality should be tested by invoking the dmg tool through subcommand. 

*Expected results:* dmg tool should be able to scan and report information netowork devices in a node. 

*Verification:* Verifying of this functionality will need to be implemented from a different tool to make sure information from dmg tool is accurate.

