description:
1. Cleanup the per-thread ds_cont_hdl & ds_cont_child code:
    - ds_pool_child should be referenced by ds_cont_child but not ds_cont_hdl;
    - per-node ds_cont isn't used, should be removed;
    - try to avoid directly holding ds_pool_child within container module when ds_cont_child has already been held for referencing;
    - decouple aggregation ULT, resync ULT, etc with container open/close, they should stick with container cache (ds_cont_child) but not ds_cont_hdl;

2. ds_cont_hdl, ds_cont_child, ds_pool, ds_pool_child, ds_pool_hdl should be cleared before pool destroy;

