description:
Aggregation configuration needs be set through 'dmg pool set-prop', the space reclaim policy DAOS_PROP_PO_RECLAIM could be used for this purpose, I think we can start with 3 policies:
- disabled: totally disable aggregation on the pool;
- lazy: only schedule aggregation when the server is idle;
- regular: schedule aggregation regularly (time interval based);

This ticket is to track the control plane (dmg & Go API) and metadata server (updating prop in RDB, propagating through IV) changes, the change to io server will is tracked in DAOS-3614 & DAOS-3817.

